WEBVTT

00:03.620 --> 00:04.860
Aw.

00:05.390 --> 00:07.540
Are you already turning back?

00:11.340 --> 00:12.220
Who's there?!

00:15.500 --> 00:19.220
She's emitting such an intense aura…
Who is this girl?

00:19.640 --> 00:21.340
Rud, this is bad!

00:25.060 --> 00:26.280
Oh, dear.

00:26.740 --> 00:30.640
Did I set it so that Dark Skeletons
would continue to spawn?

00:31.480 --> 00:32.960
Set?

00:32.960 --> 00:34.920
If we get attacked
by four of them at once…

00:37.800 --> 00:39.340
She took all of them down in one hit.

00:43.200 --> 00:44.300
I didn't expect...

00:44.520 --> 00:46.800
a demon lord-class
guardian would appear.

00:46.800 --> 00:47.760
Demon lord-class?!

00:48.200 --> 00:54.480
I thought I'd already disabled that.

00:54.900 --> 00:57.940
Is this girl the labyrinth guardian?

00:58.320 --> 01:01.320
Surrender yourself to my Demon Eye!

01:14.030 --> 01:23.840
(The Strongest Tank's Labyrinth Raids,
A Tank with a Rare 9999 Resistance Skill
Got Kicked from the Hero’s Party)

02:35.920 --> 02:39.240
What's with
this ridiculously powerful magic?

02:39.540 --> 02:41.420
But I can still handle this much.

02:42.960 --> 02:47.510
You actually managed to get out of that
without a status ailment.

02:48.200 --> 02:50.720
God's skill is indeed something.

02:50.960 --> 02:52.860
Are you the guardian
of this labyrinth?

02:52.860 --> 02:54.200
Correct.

02:54.200 --> 02:57.940
But you don't seem
intimidated by me at all.

02:58.420 --> 03:01.520
After all, you look like a cute girl.

03:03.200 --> 03:04.650
Cute?

03:04.650 --> 03:06.680
My, you have such a way with words.

03:06.690 --> 03:08.100
Don't be fooled, Rud!

03:08.100 --> 03:10.360
She's a 300-year-old granny!

03:11.340 --> 03:13.960
Silence, Marius!

03:14.420 --> 03:16.780
You are but a fallen demon lord!

03:17.260 --> 03:19.160
Marius is my friend.

03:19.760 --> 03:21.500
I ask that you do not harm him.

03:22.400 --> 03:24.160
I see.

03:24.160 --> 03:28.180
The fallen demon lord has
joined the likes of humans.

03:28.180 --> 03:30.240
Not exactly.

03:30.240 --> 03:32.600
I simply dislike
the rest of you demon lords.

03:34.440 --> 03:36.680
I see…

03:37.120 --> 03:37.940
Regardless...

03:38.300 --> 03:41.160
Do not get in my way,
Demon Lord Marius.

03:41.460 --> 03:45.280
You should be aware
that you are no match for me.

03:46.900 --> 03:50.280
Marius might not be able
to take you down on his own,

03:50.280 --> 03:53.840
but you're up against
more than just him.

03:55.620 --> 03:58.000
And?

03:58.000 --> 04:02.620
Your powers are far
from those of a demon lord.

04:02.990 --> 04:06.120
It's true that alone,
a human's power is nothing to fear.

04:06.380 --> 04:08.720
We can't conquer labyrinths alone.

04:09.000 --> 04:11.340
That is why we form parties.

04:11.560 --> 04:13.700
To raid them together?

04:13.900 --> 04:16.540
Then let's see if you can defeat me,
the guardian of the Caird Labyrinth,

04:16.540 --> 04:18.820
Amon Sloth,

04:18.820 --> 04:22.800
with your so-called teamwork.

04:23.020 --> 04:25.520
Foolish humans!

04:26.290 --> 04:28.040
Such powerful magic!

04:28.040 --> 04:30.040
We just have to take her on.

04:30.990 --> 04:32.190
Sacrificial Shield!

04:34.980 --> 04:36.220
Taunt!

04:39.980 --> 04:41.410
Such power…

04:47.420 --> 04:49.100
How dare you hurt my sister!

04:50.200 --> 04:52.480
She deflected it with a tornado.

04:52.690 --> 04:56.860
Even with Taunt,
she won't focus only on me.

04:58.260 --> 05:02.240
Although it's impressive,
his level of attack won't hurt me at all.

05:02.580 --> 05:04.600
Then we'll keep attacking until we do!

05:04.860 --> 05:08.260
I can easily evade
that kind of attack with wind magic…

05:08.260 --> 05:10.500
Don't think you can stay
in the air forever!

05:10.500 --> 05:11.500
That hurt!

05:12.100 --> 05:14.000
What a nuisance…

05:20.000 --> 05:22.000
Her physical strength is no joke.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.860
How do we break through?

05:24.100 --> 05:25.880
Don't worry, I can keep up with her.

05:26.590 --> 05:28.580
Is this the extent of your abilities?

05:28.880 --> 05:29.920
Taunt!

05:31.300 --> 05:32.640
What's the matter?

05:32.940 --> 05:36.140
You won't get me
with those random attacks.

05:36.140 --> 05:37.660
I'm not attacking randomly.

05:40.060 --> 05:41.700
Flash magic stone!

05:42.720 --> 05:44.560
What's that? It's blinding!

05:49.660 --> 05:50.740
How about that?

05:54.700 --> 05:55.780
What is that?

05:55.900 --> 05:59.160
Is this tempest the result
of the magic overflow from earlier?

05:59.490 --> 06:01.920
It appears I was careless.

06:02.990 --> 06:05.340
My apologies.

06:08.280 --> 06:10.040
Nin, heal everyone up.

06:10.360 --> 06:11.460
Got it.

06:11.460 --> 06:14.020
I'll also cast some buffs.
Gather around, everyone.

06:14.520 --> 06:19.160
That girl is on an entirely different level
from the monsters we've faced before.

06:19.340 --> 06:20.500
Yeah.

06:21.700 --> 06:24.680
But as long as we stand united,
no monster is our match.

06:25.210 --> 06:28.700
I will fight hard
for Master and Lady Manicia.

06:28.700 --> 06:29.900
Me too.

06:30.200 --> 06:31.690
Same here, of course.

06:31.690 --> 06:35.120
Count me in. After all, this is
a chance to defeat a demon lord.

06:37.300 --> 06:38.220
Great.

06:38.220 --> 06:40.080
We'll attack once the storm calms.

06:48.040 --> 06:49.400
A wolf?

06:49.720 --> 06:51.580
It looks just like a Fenrir.

06:57.140 --> 06:59.600
Marius, can you fight
in your monster form?

06:59.720 --> 07:02.500
If you don't mind me
attacking indiscriminately.

07:02.660 --> 07:06.020
Suppose it's better
for you to stay in this form then.

07:08.800 --> 07:12.480
This will reduce her chances
of attacking the other attackers.

07:17.060 --> 07:20.960
Next, let's see how long I can hold up
against this giant monster.

07:25.920 --> 07:27.820
That hardly did any damage to her.

07:27.820 --> 07:30.090
Her fur is as tough as armour.

07:30.380 --> 07:31.860
Keep your eyes on me!

07:33.600 --> 07:36.640
Those fangs are no joke.

07:36.880 --> 07:38.600
But her attacks are simpler now!

07:39.800 --> 07:42.100
The consecutive hits deplete
my shield force so fast.

07:42.100 --> 07:43.760
Prepare to cast long-distance magic.

07:49.300 --> 07:51.720
Doesn't seem very effective.

07:51.720 --> 07:53.540
It's a battle against the guardian.

07:53.540 --> 07:55.920
We've been prepared for this
to be a long fight.

07:57.820 --> 08:00.290
Her attacks are
actually getting stronger!

08:00.290 --> 08:02.860
Dang, I can't catch a break.

08:05.100 --> 08:06.460
Sorry, Rud.

08:06.460 --> 08:09.260
Took me some time
to gather my strength.

08:09.260 --> 08:10.760
You're good, don't worry about it.

08:11.200 --> 08:13.900
He actually cut through
that fur armour.

08:13.900 --> 08:15.560
As expected of Marius.

08:20.080 --> 08:21.760
Why is she howling?

08:22.680 --> 08:27.140
Rud, just in case, I'll cast spells
that nullify status ailments on these three.

08:27.590 --> 08:30.220
But I won't be able to heal you guys
in the meantime, so be careful.

08:30.220 --> 08:31.200
Got it.

08:35.360 --> 08:37.260
Rud, are you okay?

08:37.260 --> 08:40.039
I'm fine. My shield force seems
to be holding up.

08:40.640 --> 08:44.320
As long as I don't go down,
with their strength, we won't lose.

08:44.320 --> 08:45.600
We must endure!

08:53.100 --> 08:55.240
I'll persist until the end!

09:09.280 --> 09:10.600
Taunt!

09:12.200 --> 09:13.760
She's resilient.

09:13.760 --> 09:15.560
But her movements
are starting to slow down.

09:18.560 --> 09:19.440
What's going on?!

09:20.340 --> 09:22.560
What's with that green gust?

09:22.560 --> 09:23.900
Whatever it is,

09:24.460 --> 09:26.360
I'll slice it apart!

09:28.190 --> 09:29.080
Marius!

09:29.580 --> 09:31.160
Judging from that attack,

09:31.160 --> 09:34.820
it seems to be a wind barrier
that slashes anyone who comes near it.

09:36.220 --> 09:38.040
The magic stone on her forehead

09:38.410 --> 09:41.820
didn't shine so brightly
before she put up the barrier.

09:41.820 --> 09:44.840
Maybe if we destroy that stone,
we'll be able to defeat her.

09:44.840 --> 09:46.900
But we can't get close
to her at all with that gust.

09:47.380 --> 09:49.960
Nin, use your magic to cancel it.

09:49.960 --> 09:52.220
After that, we'll attack together!

09:52.220 --> 09:53.240
Got it!

09:54.040 --> 09:56.040
In the radiance of the holy light,

09:56.040 --> 09:57.560
the power of darkness…

09:57.890 --> 09:59.860
We need to buy time for Nin.

10:05.000 --> 10:08.080
Quietly emerging within
the unseen brilliance of white waves…

10:08.090 --> 10:11.880
It's getting hard to breathe
because of the wind.

10:12.330 --> 10:13.800
Just that alone is hard enough,

10:13.800 --> 10:16.100
and we've still got to deal
with the wind blades.

10:16.100 --> 10:17.340
This is hell…

10:17.590 --> 10:19.520
With the light of mercy
shining into the darkness…

10:19.520 --> 10:21.280
- Even so, I have to hold on!
- dissipate in silence.

10:21.580 --> 10:24.320
Prepare yourselves!
If we're attacked…

10:27.010 --> 10:29.000
She's trying to stop us
from getting closer.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.300
Render it all void!

10:31.590 --> 10:33.520
Cease your pointless struggle!

10:36.880 --> 10:38.620
I've removed the wind barrier.

10:38.620 --> 10:40.380
Destroy the stone now!

10:43.600 --> 10:44.700
You won't escape!

10:47.940 --> 10:50.580
She blocked all the attacks
on the magic stone.

10:50.580 --> 10:52.820
But in doing so,
she also left her chest vulnerable.

10:54.040 --> 10:55.420
Get her, Rud!

10:55.700 --> 10:59.120
My shield force has been
depleted by almost 30,000.

10:59.500 --> 11:00.620
Take this!

11:01.060 --> 11:03.260
Life Conversion!

11:06.990 --> 11:07.960
That's…

11:09.340 --> 11:11.160
That's different from a barrier.

11:12.380 --> 11:14.240
That's offensive wind magic!

11:14.890 --> 11:16.860
Everyone, dodge!

11:18.480 --> 11:19.300
Oh, no!

11:21.620 --> 11:23.480
That's the sound
of the shield breaking.

11:25.240 --> 11:26.680
Rud!

11:29.810 --> 11:32.460
I must hold on…

11:35.000 --> 11:38.120
If I use up all my shield force
and get seriously injured,

11:39.240 --> 11:40.320
I'll die!

11:46.700 --> 11:48.800
Rud!

11:51.290 --> 11:52.300
Has it stopped?

11:53.080 --> 11:54.600
Rud, are you all right?

11:55.120 --> 11:56.780
Yeah, I barely made it through.

11:57.860 --> 11:58.980
Lilia!

12:00.190 --> 12:00.990
Marius!

12:00.990 --> 12:01.940
Lilia!

12:02.340 --> 12:04.200
Hang in there!

12:05.880 --> 12:07.020
Rud…

12:07.820 --> 12:10.020
Thank goodness
you two are still alive.

12:16.500 --> 12:17.800
Luna, Nin,

12:17.800 --> 12:19.120
heal them.

12:19.120 --> 12:21.100
They'll be killed
if they took another attack.

12:22.040 --> 12:23.940
You've used up all your shield force.

12:23.940 --> 12:25.080
It's too dangerous!

12:25.080 --> 12:27.320
I can still use my skills without it.

12:27.320 --> 12:28.340
I can still fight.

12:28.660 --> 12:31.360
Besides, I'm the only one here
who can stop her.

12:31.910 --> 12:33.060
Got it.

12:33.420 --> 12:34.880
Luna. Lily.

12:35.690 --> 12:39.140
Moreover, I'm the one who
selfishly dragged everyone here.

12:39.140 --> 12:41.140
They came because of me.

12:41.390 --> 12:43.350
It's my responsibility
to protect all of them!

12:48.880 --> 12:51.240
I'm feeling the pain
without the shield…

12:51.240 --> 12:53.740
At this rate, I'm going to be crushed!

12:55.400 --> 12:56.200
Wind magic?!

12:57.990 --> 12:58.940
No?

13:01.690 --> 13:03.480
She can't use any more magic.

13:05.380 --> 13:06.860
She's weakened.

13:07.990 --> 13:09.600
We're so close…

13:10.100 --> 13:12.720
I hate to say it,
but we'll have to retreat for now…

13:13.240 --> 13:14.620
I can still fight.

13:15.700 --> 13:19.140
Nin, Luna, prepare your magic.

13:19.600 --> 13:22.820
From now on, I'll be the attacker.

13:23.720 --> 13:25.580
Lily, what are you saying?

13:25.580 --> 13:29.340
I'll use Fusion and take Lilia's place.

13:29.340 --> 13:32.040
She's been weakened.
We only have to defeat her.

13:32.040 --> 13:32.690
But…

13:32.690 --> 13:33.600
Rud,

13:33.600 --> 13:36.500
you said you'd listen to my request.

13:36.500 --> 13:38.540
I can still fight!

13:39.600 --> 13:41.760
What a reckless one.

13:42.590 --> 13:43.540
I understand.

13:43.540 --> 13:44.900
I'll block all the attacks.

13:44.900 --> 13:46.060
I'll help too.

13:46.070 --> 13:48.340
Let's take her down with all we have!

13:49.300 --> 13:50.180
Yes!

13:52.420 --> 13:56.840
I didn't realise how much power
I'd lose without my shield.

13:57.440 --> 13:58.110
But...

13:58.740 --> 14:00.380
I've got to buy her time.

14:04.300 --> 14:05.260
Rud!

14:05.490 --> 14:06.660
Thanks, Nin.

14:07.000 --> 14:08.520
Lily, are you ready?

14:10.560 --> 14:11.520
Ready.

14:16.560 --> 14:17.780
I'm not done yet.

14:24.640 --> 14:25.700
Rud?!

14:26.240 --> 14:30.000
Her speed isn't too different
from when Lilia's in control,

14:30.320 --> 14:32.740
but unlike her,
Lily's moves are too simple.

14:32.740 --> 14:34.460
They're too predictable.

14:34.960 --> 14:36.090
Sorry.

14:36.090 --> 14:39.120
I'm not used to this body yet.

14:39.610 --> 14:42.740
In that case, fight as you usually do.

14:43.800 --> 14:45.790
Lilia's out cold anyway.

14:45.790 --> 14:47.380
Don't worry about her.

14:48.440 --> 14:51.000
Fight in your own way!

14:51.710 --> 14:53.440
My own way?

14:53.900 --> 14:56.140
I'll do my best to buy you time
until you get used to it.

14:56.140 --> 14:58.140
So take your time.

14:59.220 --> 15:00.420
Got it.

15:01.280 --> 15:02.720
Although,

15:02.720 --> 15:06.440
given the current situation,
it's a tall order,

15:07.110 --> 15:10.580
but my comrade is fighting
so hard to change.

15:10.890 --> 15:14.160
So, it's my job to support her.

15:16.420 --> 15:17.220
Rud!

15:17.560 --> 15:18.620
Curses.

15:18.620 --> 15:22.600
In my current state, it's really hard
for me to do my job as the tank.

15:22.820 --> 15:25.060
I think I'm going
to pass out from the pain…

15:26.140 --> 15:28.880
No, these are just excuses.

15:29.220 --> 15:32.900
No matter what happens,
it's my job to protect my party.

15:35.340 --> 15:38.420
Marius used mana
as his shield force.

15:38.810 --> 15:42.580
If I do the same,
maybe I can continue to fight.

15:42.800 --> 15:44.660
Rud, she's heading towards you!

15:47.640 --> 15:49.700
It's not perfect, but it worked.

15:49.700 --> 15:51.740
Still, this isn't enough.

15:53.000 --> 15:56.680
I need to focus my mana
and transform it into my shield force!

15:59.440 --> 16:02.440
I can move more agilely,
just like when I still had my shield force.

16:02.440 --> 16:04.620
The pain in my arm is fading too.

16:05.120 --> 16:06.440
So that's how you do it.

16:08.450 --> 16:10.560
She sped up her attacks.

16:10.560 --> 16:11.860
Is she getting anxious?

16:12.480 --> 16:15.740
Unleash more mana.

16:16.890 --> 16:18.620
I can move as freely as I did

16:18.620 --> 16:20.860
when I had my shield force
surrounding me.

16:21.180 --> 16:22.460
Time for the counterattack!

16:24.500 --> 16:25.740
Lily, now!

16:26.320 --> 16:27.940
This is different from Lilia.

16:28.260 --> 16:30.860
This is my way of fighting!

16:35.060 --> 16:36.600
What power!

16:37.560 --> 16:40.460
Did she enchant the sword
with all elements?

16:43.000 --> 16:44.560
Let's end it with this!

16:45.900 --> 16:48.720
She's planning to strike
with all four elements at once!

17:08.980 --> 17:10.520
Lily! Are you okay?

17:10.800 --> 17:11.780
I'm okay…

17:11.780 --> 17:14.240
Thank you, Rud.

17:14.240 --> 17:16.480
That's my line.

17:16.480 --> 17:18.500
We won today because of you.

17:18.920 --> 17:21.800
It wasn't just me.

17:27.400 --> 17:29.020
Now, take a little break.

17:30.000 --> 17:30.940
Amon,

17:30.940 --> 17:32.480
do you want to continue?

17:33.020 --> 17:35.590
I cannot even move anymore.

17:35.590 --> 17:37.090
You put up an excellent fight.

17:37.090 --> 17:40.660
I never thought I'd see the day
I'd be defeated.

17:41.000 --> 17:43.720
I'm looking for a magic stone
that can grant any wish.

17:44.160 --> 17:45.900
Do you know anything about that?

17:46.800 --> 17:49.120
Here, take it.

17:50.690 --> 17:51.700
Thanks.

17:51.700 --> 17:56.040
Never expected my opponent to thank me.
That is a surprise indeed.

17:56.660 --> 17:58.960
Well? Are you not going
to deliver the final blow?

17:58.960 --> 18:03.520
Or are you perhaps the type
that enjoys tormenting pretty girls?

18:04.090 --> 18:06.720
You said you were a demon lord.

18:07.090 --> 18:08.840
Are there any other
demon lords like you?

18:09.240 --> 18:11.100
Of course.

18:11.100 --> 18:13.420
Though, I do not know the exact number.

18:13.780 --> 18:15.680
What is their objective?

18:16.000 --> 18:19.440
Among demon lords,
there is a popular game

18:20.300 --> 18:24.820
of how to destroy this world.

18:29.840 --> 18:31.780
And what is your goal?

18:32.160 --> 18:34.820
Do you seek to be an enemy
of the humans as a demon lord?

18:34.820 --> 18:37.760
Or do you just want
to fight strong opponents?

18:38.150 --> 18:40.080
You have an intention.

18:40.520 --> 18:41.350
Yes.

18:42.040 --> 18:43.300
Speak away.

18:44.400 --> 18:46.380
Will you help us?

18:48.090 --> 18:51.860
If the demon lords are
coming after the humans,

18:51.860 --> 18:53.740
I plan to gather forces to resist them.

18:54.180 --> 18:58.320
Then simply put a slave bracelet on me
and make me obey your command.

18:58.320 --> 19:00.920
I don't like to force
others against their will.

19:00.920 --> 19:02.780
That's why I'm asking
for your cooperation.

19:04.010 --> 19:06.940
An amusing one you are, indeed.

19:07.580 --> 19:11.200
Well, I'm not particularly attached
to my identity as a demon lord.

19:11.680 --> 19:14.660
Rather, since you have
extended an invitation,

19:16.000 --> 19:18.880
I shall gladly become your ally.

19:20.100 --> 19:21.080
Thank you.

19:22.100 --> 19:23.820
Now, let's return to the city…

19:24.340 --> 19:25.120
What's the matter?

19:25.300 --> 19:27.200
I am tired.

19:27.200 --> 19:30.220
I can't take another step. Carry me.

19:30.510 --> 19:31.510
Eh?

19:31.510 --> 19:31.520
And thus,
Eh?

19:31.520 --> 19:32.980
And thus,

19:32.980 --> 19:34.790
we successfully persuaded Amon Sloth,

19:34.790 --> 19:37.920
the guardian of Caird Labyrinth,
to join our forces.

19:38.590 --> 19:42.260
After that, the two major clans
held another ball.

19:42.260 --> 19:43.010
And I…

19:44.050 --> 19:47.360
We've successfully raided
Caird Labyrinth.

19:47.360 --> 19:49.560
Is this the map of the 51st floor?

19:49.560 --> 19:50.640
You're kidding!

19:50.640 --> 19:53.180
In exchange for
this map and information,

19:53.600 --> 19:55.840
I request an alliance
with the two clans.

19:56.770 --> 19:58.860
I announced that
in front of everyone.

19:58.860 --> 20:00.110
Of course,

20:00.110 --> 20:02.880
I didn't reveal that the guardian
had become our ally.

20:03.760 --> 20:06.280
After successfully forming an alliance
with the two major clans,

20:06.280 --> 20:08.460
we embarked on our journey
back to Avancier.

20:09.320 --> 20:11.860
I want to see Manicia soon…

20:12.380 --> 20:13.220
Rud.

20:14.540 --> 20:15.400
Rud.

20:15.940 --> 20:16.680
Li…

20:17.140 --> 20:20.480
Shh. You'll wake everyone.

20:21.500 --> 20:24.660
Thank you for your help
in the labyrinth battle.

20:24.860 --> 20:26.700
It's nothing. And I told you, didn't I?

20:26.700 --> 20:28.480
It was thanks to you…

20:29.300 --> 20:31.500
We won because of everyone's efforts.

20:31.500 --> 20:32.280
But

20:32.280 --> 20:34.700
it was thanks to you
that I could fight until the end.

20:37.180 --> 20:38.700
Thank you.

20:39.570 --> 20:41.340
I'm going back to sleep.

20:43.640 --> 20:45.200
What was that about?

20:45.200 --> 20:46.760
And she fell asleep right away.

20:47.790 --> 20:50.200
I'll just have to ask her later
what that kiss meant.

20:50.200 --> 20:52.100
I should just sleep…

20:52.100 --> 20:52.900
Rud.

20:54.120 --> 20:55.170
Lilia!

20:55.170 --> 20:57.180
Did she see that?

20:57.590 --> 21:00.060
Thank you for what you did
in the labyrinth.

21:00.420 --> 21:02.900
I heard your voice.

21:03.410 --> 21:04.500
That's all.

21:09.260 --> 21:13.380
After arriving in Avancier,
we rushed to Manicia.

21:14.640 --> 21:16.220
Manicia, use this magic stone.

21:16.880 --> 21:17.660
How do you feel?

21:18.620 --> 21:21.500
I feel so much better.

21:22.180 --> 21:23.260
Thank you so much,

21:23.600 --> 21:25.220
Miss Amon.

21:26.500 --> 21:30.180
There's not much I can do for you,

21:30.640 --> 21:34.240
but I'll put my best effort into preparing
three meals and afternoon tea for you.

21:34.840 --> 21:39.580
So, please enjoy yourself
during your stay here.

21:40.500 --> 21:45.020
Being warmly welcomed
by such a lovely human is a delight.

21:45.620 --> 21:47.780
And the snacks are delicious too.

21:48.800 --> 21:53.000
I shall remain in this town
for the time being.
